@startuml
title JSE 0.1.0 - implemented runtime
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "demo\nLaunchSettings, PreviewScene, DemoApplication" as demo
component "core\nJseEngine, SceneManager, EngineHost" as core
component "input\nInputSource, InputState, GameAction" as input
component "platform/awt\nSwingHost, GamePanel, SwingInputSource" as platform
component "render\nGraphic, Renderer, RenderMode" as render
component "render/awt\nFrameRenderer, FilledRenderer, WireframeRenderer" as awtrender
component "assets\nAssetManager, SpriteId" as assets
component "math\nVec2, Rect, Rgba" as math
artifact "jse.properties" as settings
demo ..> settings : typed configuration
demo ..> core : compose and start
demo ..> platform : desktop composition
demo ..> render : RectangleGraphic
demo ..> awtrender : renderer composition
demo ..> assets : preload before startup
core ..> input : snapshot per fixed step
core ..> render : scene painting contract
platform ..|> core : EngineHost
platform ..|> input : InputSource
platform ..> awtrender : begin/end frame
awtrender ..|> render : Renderer
awtrender ..> assets : cache-only sprite lookup
render ..> math
assets ..> math
platform ..> math
demo ..> math
note bottom of core
No World, AI or EventBus dependency.
Scene transitions and shutdown run on the starting thread.
end note
@enduml
